\begin{note}
The decorators \lstinline{@dataclass} and \lstinline{@total_ordering} are just functions that take a class,
add methods to it, and return the modified class.
We can write our own class decorators in exactly the same way.
This is how libraries like \lstinline{attrs}, \lstinline{torch.nn.Module}, and every ORM define their classes.
\end{note}
